{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15551","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 杨系","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胜游从小苑，宫柳望春晴。\n拂地青丝嫩，萦风绿带轻。\n光含烟色远，影透水文清。\n玉笛吟何得，金闺画岂成。\n皇风吹欲断，圣日映逾明。\n愿驻高枝上，还同出谷莺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}